Package: preview
Version: 1.0.0
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Vikram Balai <vikrambalai1002@gmail.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10),
         python3-gi (>= 3.42),
         python3-cairo,
         gir1.2-gtk-4.0 (>= 4.10),
         gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.4),
         gir1.2-gdkpixbuf-2.0,
         gir1.2-graphene-1.0
Recommends: gir1.2-poppler-0.18, poppler-utils, python3-gi-cairo
Suggests: libheif-gdk-pixbuf, webp-pixbuf-loader
Homepage: https://github.com/nxtwave/preview
Description: Image and PDF viewer for the Linux desktop
 Preview is a fast viewer for images and PDF documents, built with GTK4 and
 libadwaita so it matches the rest of a modern GNOME desktop.
 .
 It opens every format the system has a GdkPixbuf loader for - including PNG,
 JPEG, WebP, AVIF, HEIC, JPEG XL, TIFF and SVG - alongside multi-page PDFs.
 Documents open in tabs, each with a thumbnail sidebar, continuous or single
 page scrolling, zoom to fit, fill or actual size, rotation, full text search
 across PDF pages, rectangular selection with cropping, export between image
 formats, a timed slideshow and printing.
 .
 PDF support uses the Poppler GObject bindings when gir1.2-poppler-0.18 is
 installed, and falls back to the poppler-utils command line tools otherwise.
